  tutorialClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a08433676a08be14180e37f30cfa7bbf, type: 3}
  subtitleList:
  - "Alright, cadet \u2014 time to tune your controls."
  - To fly this craft with your mind, we need to understand how your brain behaves
    in different conditions.
  - "First, we\u2019ll throw a few challenges your way\u2014nothing too wild, just
    some quick mental math."
  - "That\u2019ll show us what your brainpower looks like when it's fully engaged."
  - "Then, you\u2019ll close your eyes and relax. Let your thoughts drift."
  - "That helps us read your baseline when you\u2019re calm."
  - "Relax, focus, and let the system do the reading. We\u2019re just calibrating
    your flight gear."
